        },
        {
          "text": "E’yo acepiri ’di, adripi, emi ma zi Mungu ama dri, e’yo oluza Opini ma idri i ani drile drile mbele, ma ovu inzizaru ekile emi eseliarile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
